    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to own the world's best laundry store? Transform a small laundry shop into a laundry empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the following features in Laundry Store Simulator: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150440/extras/66d4db01232ed1e0885aaf53ed9eb998.avif?t=1753361585\" width=600 height=89 /></span>Build a small laundry store into a thriving business empire! Upgrade your equipment, design and expand your store, hire staff, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150440/extras/ef953b48268f06c8467c4b47a0c1cf8c.poster.avif?t=1753361585\" width=640 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150440/extras/ef953b48268f06c8467c4b47a0c1cf8c.webm?t=1753361585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150440/extras/ef953b48268f06c8467c4b47a0c1cf8c.mp4?t=1753361585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150440/extras/b2cc5ffe361ff570d74453c6c02d112a.avif?t=1753361585\" width=600 height=89 /></span>Upgrade your equipment to provide exceptional cleaning services! Invest in high-quality washing machines, dryers, ironing equipment, and even automated washing machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150440/extras/284829a4413dc13002762ce305c93cf0.poster.avif?t=175336158